    "limits": "Design evidence only. Candidate alters controlled-store wiring, shadow-query removal and capture-phase composition refusal, not final stale-item, pointer-gesture, mount or provider focus behavior. Happy DOM uses real Ariakit and core editor with mocked Plate React hooks; no fresh browser, physical IME, full typecheck or final production operation measurement. Owner timings mount only the picker over editor state. Emoji timings are pure search. Raw prototype fixtures/receipts live in ignored node_modules cache and will be unavailable in a fresh checkout. Global ledger check remains red for the pre-existing unrelated browser/markdown-streaming-contract inventory; autocomplete outcome is validated separately. Design completion establishes no adoption."
